# Voice Profile

Extracted from the source manuscript(s) listed in `CLAUDE.md`. The narrative voice the rewrite preserves while suppressing the bad habits catalogued in `polish-targets.md`.

If the source uses multiple POV narrators, each gets its own section below. Habits that travel across all narrators are author-level voice — the rewrite keeps them across the board. Habits unique to one narrator are character-level voice and must be held distinct.

Reviewers cite this file by section, e.g. `voice §<narrator>.<aspect>`.

